## ✨ Features

### 🏠 Home

* Responsive hero section
* Featured products
* Random products displayed on every refresh
* Auto-sliding testimonial carousel
* Dark / Light mode
* Sticky navigation bar
* Mobile-friendly hamburger menu

### 🛍️ Products

* Products fetched from the Fake Store API
* Search products
* Filter by category
* Responsive product grid
* Loading indicator
* Dynamic product cards

### 📞 Contact

* Contact form
* Client-side validation
* Newsletter subscription
* Success message after submission

### 🎯 General

* Responsive design
* Semantic HTML5
* CSS Grid & Flexbox
* Reusable components
* Accessible navigation
* Keyboard-friendly interface
* Theme persistence with Local Storage

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (ES6 Modules)

### CSS

* Flexbox
* CSS Grid
* Media Queries
* Animations
* Responsive Design
* CSS Variables

### JavaScript

* Fetch API
* Async / Await
* DOM Manipulation
* ES6 Modules
* Local Storage
* Form Validation

### API

* Fake Store API

