## ♿ Accessibility

This project follows accessibility best practices:

* Semantic HTML5
* Proper heading hierarchy
* ARIA attributes
* Keyboard navigation
* Skip navigation link
* Form labels
* Focus indicators
* Descriptive image alt text
* Responsive typography
* High color contrast

---

## ⚡ Performance Optimizations

* Asynchronous API requests
* Modular JavaScript
* Efficient DOM updates
* Responsive layouts
* Optimized CSS
* Theme persistence with Local Storage

---

## ⚠️ Current Limitations

* No backend integration
* Contact form is frontend only
* No authentication
* No shopping cart
* No checkout flow
* No product details page
* Product data depends on the Fake Store API

